# Component authoring

Before creating a new React component, or substantially changing an existing
one's props API or composition shape — in `frontend-web/src`, `frontend-admin/src`,
`packages/frontend-shared/src`, or `packages/content-kit/src` (per ADR-032) —
read and follow
[.cursor/skills/component-authoring/SKILL.md](../skills/component-authoring/SKILL.md).

Do not duplicate that guidance here — this rule only points to it.
